    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55157" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατασκήν-ωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>encamping, taking up one's quarters</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>1 Ch.</u>
				28.2
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλεῖν τινα πρὸς κατασκήνωσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					11.26.5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διδόναι εἰς κ.</span> to give
			them as <i>quarters</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				229.57
			</span></i> (Smyrna, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν
				κ.</span> in <i>camp</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				11.6
			</span></i>: pl. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκηνώσεις βασιλέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					11.2.9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of birds,
				<i>restingplace, nest,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ev.Matt.
				8.20
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
